# Check the latest version first

Before any edit in this repo:

1. Run `git fetch origin` and `git status`.
2. If the branch tracks `origin` and is behind, run `git pull --ff-only`.
3. Read the current `home.css` and `index.html` on that commit before changing layout.

Do not redesign from memory or from an older local file. If a preview or deployment URL is the reference, find the commit it was built from (`git log`, `gh`) before editing. Never replace the editorial homepage with an earlier layout.
